---
layout: layouts/blog-base.njk
title: Newsletter
permalink: /newsletter/
excerpt: "The Wild Atlas newsletter — new packs, app updates, and a free printable coloring book in every issue. Subscribe and the Farm Friends pack is free."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

{#-
  /newsletter/ is a PRINTED destination, not just a web page: the end-cap of
  every coloring book PDF carries a QR code to
  wildatlasapp.com/newsletter?utm_source=coloring_book… (see PetPeeper
  coloring_pages/scripts/generate_endcap_v1_revised.py). Those PDFs shipped
  inside the app in v1.0.5 and cannot be recalled, so this path has to keep
  resolving to something sensible indefinitely — signup first, archive second.

  Do NOT add a /newsletter rule to _redirects. Cloudflare Pages evaluates
  _redirects before serving static assets, so a redirect there would shadow
  this page entirely.
-#}

<section class="newsletter-index">
  <header>
    <h1>The Wild Atlas Newsletter</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem;">
      New packs, app updates, and notes on how young kids actually take this stuff in.
      Every issue comes with a free printable coloring book for the kids. A few times a year — no more.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="email-signup" aria-labelledby="es-newsletter-heading" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <div class="email-signup-inner">
      <p class="email-signup-eyebrow">For parents &amp; guardians</p>
      <h2 id="es-newsletter-heading" class="email-signup-heading">The app is for the kids. This part is for you.</h2>
      <p class="email-signup-sub">New packs, app features, and an occasional note. Sent a few times a year &mdash; no more.</p>
      <p class="email-signup-incentive"><img class="incentive-icon" src="/assets/newsletter-gift.png" alt="">Subscribe and the <strong>Farm Friends</strong> pack ($3.99) is <strong>free</strong> &mdash; yours to keep even if you unsubscribe.</p>
      <form class="email-signup-form" action="/api/subscribe" method="POST" novalidate>
        <input type="hidden" name="source" value="newsletter-page">
        <div class="email-signup-row">
          <label class="sr-only" for="es-newsletter-email">Email address</label>
          <input id="es-newsletter-email" class="email-signup-input" type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" placeholder="your@email.com">
          <button class="email-signup-btn" type="submit">Subscribe</button>
        </div>
        <label class="email-signup-consent">
          <input type="checkbox" name="consent" required>
          <span>I agree to receive occasional emails from Wild Atlas about new packs, app updates, and parent notes.</span>
        </label>
        <p class="email-signup-fine">We email occasionally &mdash; easy to unsubscribe anytime. We use <a href="https://www.beehiiv.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">beehiiv</a> to send these emails. See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        <p class="email-signup-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1.5px solid rgba(93, 64, 55, 0.08); margin: var(--space-2xl) 0 2rem;">

  <h2>Past issues</h2>

  {% set issues = collections.newsletter | reverse %}
  {% if issues.length == 0 %}
    <p><em>The first issue is on its way.</em></p>
  {% else %}
    <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1.5rem 0 0;">
      {% for issue in issues %}
        <li style="padding: 1.25rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);">
          <a href="{{ issue.url }}" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
            <p style="color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 0.25rem; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;">
              Issue No. {{ issue.data.issueNumber }} &middot; {{ issue.data.issueDate }}
            </p>
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.35rem; color: var(--accent);">{{ issue.data.title }}</h3>
            {% if issue.data.excerpt %}
              <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;">{{ issue.data.excerpt }}</p>
            {% endif %}
          </a>
        </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  {% endif %}

  <script src="/js/email-signup.js?v=2" defer></script>
</section>
